         "wizards/morgoth/cannibal/room/path53", "southwest",
         "wizards/morgoth/cannibal/room/path52", "southeast",
         "A path in cannibal village.",
         "You are on a rocky path in cannibal village.\n" + 
         "North from here is kings hut.\n", 3)
